              "text": "Multiply the specialized inequality by two and normalize the real arithmetic.",
              "formula": "2\\alpha\\Gamma(f)\\le L\\Gamma(f)-2\\Gamma(f,Lf)",
              "lean": "nlinarith closes the scalar real inequality."
