        "text": "Let X be an arbitrary type, let L : (X → ℝ) →ₗ[ℝ] (X → ℝ) be a real-linear generator, and let α ∈ ℝ with α > 0. Suppose that for every g : X → ℝ and every y ∈ X, α Γ_L(g,g)(y) ≤ (1/2)(L(Γ_L(g,g))(y) - Γ_L(g,Lg)(y) - Γ_L(g,Lg)(y)). Then, for every f : X → ℝ and every x ∈ X, 2α Γ_L(f,f)(x) ≤ L(Γ_L(f,f))(x) - 2Γ_L(f,Lf)(x).",
